      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GREEDY BUTCHER (2) has a moderate overall strike-rate. Better run when finding the frame last time though, finishing third (19.98) at this track. Has a good record here including three wins. Goes well out of this box with a win and four minor placings. Sure to be about the mark. RAVING LUNATIC (5) jumped from the inside and boxed on well to finish second last time, beaten a nose (26.27) behind Scarred at this track. Has performed well from this box with a win and two minor placings to his name from five starts. Must be included in calculations. SUNDARA (1) had a tricky draw and ran well to finish second, beaten half a length, (26.46) at this track. Deserves a win and gets her chance. ASTON PERK (8) can return to form after missing the top-three at this circuit last time out.",
